==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|asks for|asking for|asked for}}

# to [[request]]
#: {{ux|en|I '''asked for''' a glass of water.}}
# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} To [[increase]] the [[likelihood]] of something by [[persisting]] in some [[action]]; to [[invite]].
#: {{ux|en|If you keep on speeding, you are '''asking for''' trouble.}}

